WEBVTT

00:00.780 --> 00:03.890
Zingatia mlinganyo huu wenye hasi 5

00:03.890 --> 00:06.620
jumlisha 4 mara x.

00:06.620 --> 00:09.650
Sasa, chukua zao la hasi 8 na

00:09.650 --> 00:11.160
kisha ongeza 6.

00:11.160 --> 00:12.930
Sasa hebu tufanye hatua kwa hatua.

00:12.930 --> 00:15.340
Kwanza, kwenye huu mlinganyo tuna hasi 5

00:15.340 --> 00:17.040
jumlisha kitu fulani.

00:17.040 --> 00:22.115
Hivyo itakuwa hasi 5 jumlisha 4 mara x.

00:24.730 --> 00:26.730
Vizuri, itakuwa ni 4x.

00:26.730 --> 00:29.510
Kwa hiyo itakuwa hasi 5 jumlisha 4x.

00:29.510 --> 00:31.520
Hivyo huo ndio huu mlinganyo hapa.

00:31.520 --> 00:33.770
Sasa, chukua zao la hasi 8,

00:33.770 --> 00:36.120
hivyo tunachukua hasi 8,

00:36.120 --> 00:38.500
na tutazidisha zao kwa hasi 8

00:38.500 --> 00:39.595
na huo mlinganyo.

00:39.595 --> 00:40.970
Hivyo tutachukua hasi 8

00:40.970 --> 00:43.390
na kuizidisha na hivyo huo mlinganyo

00:43.390 --> 00:48.290
ni huu hapa.

00:48.290 --> 00:52.150
Kama tukisema zao la hasi 8 kwenye huo mlinganyo

00:52.150 --> 00:56.520
utakuwa hasi 8 mara huo mlinganyo,

00:56.520 --> 01:01.180
huo mlinganyo ni hasi 5 jumlisha 4x, hivyo  hiyo ni hasi 8.

01:01.180 --> 01:02.640
Huo ndio mlinganyo.

01:02.640 --> 01:08.269
Zao la mbili, hivyo tunaweza kuweka alama ya kuzidisha hapa,

01:08.269 --> 01:10.060
au tunaweza kuicha bila kuweka

01:10.060 --> 01:12.210
na bado itamaanisha kuzidisha,

01:12.210 --> 01:14.720
chukua zao la hasi 8 na huo mlinganyo

01:14.720 --> 01:16.170
na kisha ongeza 6.

01:19.960 --> 01:23.550
Kwa hiyo tutaongeza 6 hapa.

01:23.550 --> 01:27.860
Hivyo tunaweza kuandika hasi 8 fungua mabano hasi 5

01:27.860 --> 01:31.370
jumlisha 4x na kisha ongeza 6.

01:31.370 --> 01:33.360
Hebu tufanye nyingine.

01:33.360 --> 01:39.920
Kwanza, zingatia mlinganyo wenye jumla ya 7 na-- hivyo

01:39.920 --> 01:41.710
itakuwa 7 jumlisha kitu fulani--

01:41.710 --> 01:44.590
na zao la hasi 2 na x.

01:44.590 --> 01:49.690
Zao la hasi 2 na x ni hasi 2x.

01:49.690 --> 01:52.020
Hivyo ni 7 jumlisha hasi 2x.

01:52.020 --> 01:55.150
Tunaweza kuandika kama 7 toa 2x.

01:55.150 --> 01:59.300
Hivyo hii ni sawa na 7 toa 2x.

01:59.300 --> 02:01.350
Hii ni milinganyo sawa.

02:01.350 --> 02:04.420
Mlinganyo utakuwaje 4 jumlisha?

02:04.420 --> 02:09.830
Sasa tunasema 4 jumlisha

02:09.830 --> 02:11.460
2 mara huo mlinganyo?

02:11.460 --> 02:16.200
Hivyo itakuwa 4 mara idadi kadhaa.

02:16.200 --> 02:17.570
Nitaweka hiyo kwenye mabano.

02:17.570 --> 02:20.680
Idadi ya 2 mara-- nitafanya hiyo

02:20.680 --> 02:24.610
katika rangi ya damu ya mzee au njano.

02:24.610 --> 02:29.920
2 mara huo mlinganyo-- ngoja nifanye kwa rangi ya bluu--

02:29.920 --> 02:32.720
huo mlinganyo ni huu hapa.

02:32.720 --> 02:39.230
Hivyo 4 jumlisha idadi ya 2 mara huo mlinganyo, 2 mara

02:39.230 --> 02:42.340
7 toa 2x.

02:42.340 --> 02:44.408
Na tumemaliza.

02:44.408 --> 02:44.908
&nbsp;
